{
  "id": "front-matter",
  "title": "怎样发挥党支部的战斗堡垒作用",
  "level": 0,
  "html": "<h1 id=\"docx-p-0000\">怎样发挥党支部的战斗堡垒作用</h1>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0001\">山东人民出版社</p>\n<h2 id=\"docx-p-0002\">毛主席语录</h2>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0003\"><strong>领导我们事业的核心力量是中国共产党。</strong></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0004\"><strong>指导我们思想的理论基础是马克思列宁主义。</strong></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0005\"><strong>党组织应是无产阶级先进分子所组成的，能领导无产阶级和革命群众对于阶级敌人进行战斗的朝气蓬勃的先锋队组织。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"docx-p-0006\">目录</h2>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0007\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-01/#docx-p-0033\"><strong>把看书学习当作一件大事来抓</strong>（即墨县城关公社磨市大队党支部）</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0008\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-01/#docx-p-0036\">种田人一定要学习革命理论</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0009\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-01/#docx-p-0041\">在克服困难中把学习坚持下去</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0010\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-01/#docx-p-0049\">围绕方向路线问题看书学习</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0011\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-02/#docx-p-0059\"><strong>联系斗争实际 进行路线教育</strong>（成武县九女公社包庄大队党支部）</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0012\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-02/#docx-p-0062\">运用“三条基本原则”进行路线教育 不断提高识别真假马克思主义的能力</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0013\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-02/#docx-p-0069\">围绕方向道路问题进行路线教育 不断巩固农村社会主义阵地</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0014\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-02/#docx-p-0076\">从路线斗争的高度进行政策教育</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0015\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-02/#docx-p-0077\">不断提高执行党的政策的自觉性</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0016\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-03/#docx-p-0084\"><strong>认真落实党的政策</strong>（滕县鲍沟公社吕坡大队党支部）</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0017\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-03/#docx-p-0087\">政策兑了现，事事都好办</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0018\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-03/#docx-p-0092\">分清是非界限，排除“左”右干扰</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0019\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-03/#docx-p-0098\">必须把政策交给群众</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0020\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-03/#docx-p-0105\">克服私心，增强党性</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0021\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-04/#docx-p-0113\"><strong>认真实行党的民主集中制</strong>（曲阜县东风公社夏家村大队党支部）</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0022\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-04/#docx-p-0118\">“班长”要带头发扬民主，让人讲话</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0023\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-04/#docx-p-0125\">不但要民主，尤其要集中</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0024\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-04/#docx-p-0135\">要认真改造世界观</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0025\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-05/#docx-p-0142\"><strong>做革命团结的模范</strong>（滕县龙阳公社沙土大队党总支）</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0026\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-05/#docx-p-0145\">首先要搞好“一班人”的团结</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0027\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-05/#docx-p-0151\">还要做好团结群众的工作</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0028\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-05/#docx-p-0157\">从斗争中求团结</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0029\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-06/#docx-p-0164\"><strong>干部要坚持参加集体生产劳动</strong>（邹县城前公社大崇村大队党支部）</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0030\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-06/#docx-p-0167\">要时刻想到自己是普通劳动者</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0031\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-06/#docx-p-0174\">有助于贯彻党的路线和政策</a></p>\n<p id=\"docx-p-0032\"><a href=\"/zuoren-shelf/texts/party-branch-fortress/chapter-06/#docx-p-0181\">贵在坚持</a></p>"
}
